# O2X Product Design skill — Single Source of Truth

- Edit O2X skill instructions only in this repository under `.cursor/skills/o2x-*`.
- Global O2X entries under `~/.claude/skills`, `~/.codex/skills`, `~/.cursor/skills` and `~/.agents/skills` must be symbolic links to those directories, never separately maintained copies. Check them with `.cursor/skills/o2x-polish-distill/scripts/link_global_skills.sh` (`--fix` creates missing links).
- Resolve the actual SKILL.md path before following relative references. The repository root owns `design.md` and `tokens/`.
- Keep local compatibility aliases as links only. Do not copy content into old skill or resource directories.
- After updates, verify global entries resolve to the canonical files; no second synchronization or content rewrite is needed.
